  "name": "Overnight Refrigerator Oatmeal",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "Refrigerator oatmeal is prepared at night, refrigerated, and ready to eat in the morning for a portable breakfast. Add your favorite fruit or nuts!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir oats, yogurt, and almond milk together in a jar with a lid. Twist lid onto jar and refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight. Stir oatmeal and add banana when ready to eat."
    }
